    test-distinct.R and test-slice.R. They use typed dibbles, stable row IDs,
    explicit Stata metadata and symmetric mutation checks. The retained
    Stage 6 caller witnesses additionally informed group-frame and empty-group
    cases. Preparation drafts and their failed expectations are not package
    qualification; the integrated tests are checked on the installed source.
