  Package-specific Stage 8 finalizer changes remove unused column-context
    lineage bindings for the current sources=NULL callers, reuse an already
    prepared repeated slot, and key constructor/reserve caches by the actual
    normalized or current physical object. Public utils address hashes replace
    per-address environment names. Atomic nested capture performs its existing
    metadata copy before any list memo is allocated. No additional R or utils
